            "Given the information provided and the\n",
            "\n",
            "\n",
            "DECISION SUPPORT BRIEF FOR: L006\n",
            "## Step 1: Strengths\n",
            "The applicant, Kofi, appears to be young and enthusiastic, with a stated age of 22 and a claim of being \"full of energy.\" This could potentially be a positive trait for starting new businesses. Additionally, Kofi mentions that friends consider him to be \"very business-minded,\" which might indicate some level of entrepreneurial spirit or aptitude.\n",
            "\n",
