            "There are several significant concerns with this application. Firstly, Kofi has no prior experience in any of the businesses he wishes to start (car washing, provision shop, and importing phones), which increases the risk of failure. Secondly, the lack of collateral poses a significant risk for the bank in case of default. Thirdly, the repayment plan is overly optimistic, relying on the businesses booming within a year, which is not guaranteed. Lastly, the diversification into three different businesses simultaneously could spread resources too thin and increase the likelihood of failure.\n",
